From 84cde87ec4f539fd149bab07da6785ddeba8817b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 12:25:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Skip the shell layout flyout for Explorer transfers

Copy here/Move here already resolves one unambiguous destination, but
BeginShellLayoutAsync still opened the destination/layout flyout to ask
Preserve vs Contents-only before Start became reachable. On the compact
window that flyout could exceed the visible surface, leaving the user
unable to reach StartCopyButton at all.

Apply the default layout (PreserveSourceFolder) and start the transfer
directly from the shell path instead. Document the change in
UI_SPEC.md and record the regression lesson in ENGINEERING_RULES.md.
Add an architecture check so the shell path can never reopen the
flyout via ShowAt again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ES4cL9Ffbhg4AnZxU4aeUh
